WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Can you add 3x and 2x²?

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.710
No.

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.350
They're different kinds of term.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.190
Only like terms combine.

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.100
3x + 4x = 7x

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.016
Treat x and x² like apples and oranges.
